'''Dingle''' is a [[boss]] that can appear:
* {{Dlc|nr}} Only in the {{s|Basement}}.
* {{Dlc+|r}} In the {{s|Basement}} and the {{s|Burning Basement}}.{{dlc-}}
He is the boss version of the {{e|Dip}}s.

== Behavior ==
Dingle remains stationary and performs the following attacks:
* Fires 3 projectiles towards Isaac.
* Whistles before summoning 1-3 Dips and then fires 3 projectiles at Isaac.
* Quickly performs 3 long dashes towards Isaac while bouncing off obstacles and walls, after which he pauses to catch his breath.
** Dips caught in his dashes are knocked back a distance.
** Occasionally, Dingle will leave behind a {{E|Poop}} while using this attack.

== Champion Versions {{unlockable}} ==
: {{bc|18|dlc=a}}: Dingle summons {{e|Spider}}s instead of Dips and fires eight shots in all directions instead of spitting three at Isaac. He also dashes much faster, but will only dash one time instead of three.
: {{bc|1|dlc=a}}: Dingle creates a {{E|Red Poop}} instead of summoning Dips. He also dashes four times instead of three, though the dashes are shorter and slower. {{Dlc|r}} He also fires blood projectiles instead of poop projectiles, though this is a purely cosmetic effect.

